  "description": "Endless Adventure Awaits!\nRide where you want to, when you want to.Explore more hills and roads with ZUGO Step Thru Electric Fat Tire Bike!ZUGU Step Thru stands out as one of the best step thru electric bikes in this category.Enjoy 750W Geared Hub Motor and up to 80 miles of range per charge! The combination of fat tires with puncture protection and a powerful motor offers better traction and grip in sand, snow, mud, or water. Ride anywhere, in any weather.ZUGO electric bike step thru frame design is made with 100% aluminum alloy. This e-bike boasts a 750W Geared Hub Motor with up to 80 miles of range on a single charge with our 20Ah lithium battery!Its extra-long seat allows this electric bike to be shared with a friend or a partner, while its dual suspension forks, fat tires, and larger chainrings allow you to explore more off-road terrain with extra stability and control. This combination of fat tires with puncture protection and a powerful motor offers better traction and grip in sand, snow, mud, or water. Ride our electric bike anywhere, in any weather.Whether you're looking for your next commuter or a pedaling machine that's fun and convenient, this electric bike is sure to leave a lasting impression on everyone!\n\n750W Geared Hub Motor\nUp to 80 miles of Range per Charge (with 20Ah Removable Battery)\nHydraulic Brakes - Class Leading 2-Piston stopping force\nRain & Dust Proof - Rated IP67\nAluminum Alloy 6061 Frame\nAdjustable Handlebar Height (from ground to handlebar 44\" to 49\" height adjustment)\nShimano Altus 7 Speed Trigger Shifter Drivetrain\nLarge Platform Forged Aluminum Pedals\nAll-Terrain Fat Tires (20\" x 4\")\nCup Holder Built Into Frame\n\nUp to to 20Ah (1008 watt-hours) Samsung Cells Lithium Removable Battery\n48V 750W Geared Hub Motor\nThumb Throttle\nBeautiful Display w/ 7 level Electronic Pedal Assist System\nUSB Phone Charging Port on Handlebars\nIP67 Water & Dust-proof Electronics & Connectors\nAC 120V 2A Charger\nUse 